# Any task-orchestrator.config*.json variant (task-orchestrator.config.json,
# task-orchestrator.config.copilot.json, etc.) commonly holds provider API
# keys and must never be committed -- except the schema file, which is a
# static JSON Schema doc with no secrets and is meant to ship with the repo.
task-orchestrator.config*.json
!task-orchestrator.config.schema.json
task-orchestrator.config*.json.bak
config.json
config.json.bak
state.json
orchestrator.pid
logs/
*.env
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
*.lock
